          "id": "documentation",
          "label": "Documentation",
          "value": "Creates a prompt that enables users to select an option from a list of options.
Use dropdown on edit pages when you want the user to select a single option from a dropdown list. You can also use the dropdown tag with the dropdownEditButton.
The dropdown widget value is a list of strings."
        },
